    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kughwa kwa Jerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Sedekia ukamlegha mzuri wa Babuloni; na mwaka ghwake ghwa ikenda ghobonya nguma mori ghwa ikumi, Nebukadnezari mzuri wa Babuloni ukacha Jerusalemu na ijeshi jake jose; ukaghurughaia na kughubonyera isanju chia rose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.21.1+JER.21.2+JER.21.3+JER.21.4+JER.21.5+JER.21.6+JER.21.7+JER.21.8+JER.21.9+JER.21.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jer. 21.1-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.34.1+JER.34.2+JER.34.3+JER.34.4+JER.34.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "34.1-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.24.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eze. 24.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muzi ugho ghukarughailwa chia rose hata mwaka ghwa ikumi na imweri ghwa kubonya nguma kwa Mzuri Sedekia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituku ja ikenda ja mori ghwa kana, njala erekoghe mbaa nandighi andenyi ya muzi, hata wandu ndewerewadieghe kindo chingi cheja anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata ngera Wababuloni werekoghe waghurughaia ugho muzi, ela wurigha ghwa muzi ghorechikanyiroghe, na masikari ghose ghikakimbia nakio kwa chia ya mbenge ghadi na ghadi ya mawurigha awi, mbuwenyi kwa mzuri; wikaghenda kwa kunugha chia ya Vololo ya Jordani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.33.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eze. 33.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela masikari gha Babuloni ghikammbinga Mzuri Sedekia na kummbwada awurindinyi ghwa Jeriko; masikari ghake ghikasasarika chia rose, wikamsigha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko wikammbwada Mzuri Sedekia na kumghenja kwa mzuri wa Babuloni aja Ribla; wikamtanya aho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikabwagha wana wa Sedekia ukiwona, wikamturua meso ghake, wikamfunga na pingu, wikamghenja Babuloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.12.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eze. 12.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kunoneka kwa Hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituku ja mfungade ja mori ghwa kasanu, mwaka ghwa ikumi na ikenda ghwa kubonya nguma kwa Nebukadnezari mzuri wa Babuloni, Nebuzaradani uo orekoghe mnjama wa Mzuri Nebukadnezari, sena nuo orekoghe m'baa wa majeshi ghake, ukacha Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukaikora Hekalu na ngome ya mzuri, na nyumba rose ra wabaa rerekoghe andenyi ya muzi ghwa Jerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.9.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Waz. 9.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho masikari gha Babuloni gherekwanyeghe nao, wikachikanya wurigha ghoremareghe muzi ghwa Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebuzaradani, uo m'baa wa walindiri ukadwa masighariko gha wandu wunyika, awo orewikueghe aho, na awo werekimbirieghe cha kwa mzuri wa Babuloni, na izungu ja wandu wose ukaghenda Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela wakiwa wichumbie, ukawisigha isanga ja Juda, wilimieghe mizabibu na kulima mbuwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wababuloni wikachikanya nguro ra shaba ra Hekalu, na vilambo va shaba na itangi ja machi, ivo verekoghe andenyi ya Hekalu, na kudwa iyo shaba cha Babuloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.7.15+1KI.7.16+1KI.7.17+1KI.7.18+1KI.7.19+1KI.7.20+1KI.7.21+1KI.7.22+1KI.7.23+1KI.7.24+1KI.7.25+1KI.7.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Waz. 7.15-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.3.15+2CH.3.16+2CH.3.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Mal. 3.15-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikadwa nyungu, miiko, vilambo veshawara wutambi, na bakuli refukiria marumba, na vilambo vose va shaba verekoghe vikitumilwa andenyi ya Hekalu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.7.45"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Waz. 7.45",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.4.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Mal. 4.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chiaimweri na chuwigha redwa modo na bakuli. Vilambo va dhahabu ukavidwa viekeri na va feza ukavidwa viekeri; vose vikadukwa ni uja m'baa wa walindiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iro nguro iwi ra shaba, na ijo itangi ja shaba, na icho kilambo chewadia itangi verebonyeroghe ni Mzuri Solomoni verekoghe vilemere nandighi visedukikagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wulacha ghwa kula nguro ghorekoghe ghwa meta wunyanya, nayo erekoghe na kishekero cha shaba aighu yaro, chiko na wuighu ghwa meta imweri na pointi idadu. Icho kishekero cherekoghe na mapambo gha shaba kuimara chia rose na makomamanga gha shaba; na nguro ya kawi erekoghe woruwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wandu wa Juda kudwalwa cha Babuloni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uja m'baa wa walindiri Nebuzaradani ukamdwa uja Mkohani M'baa Seraia, na uja mtini wake mkohani Sefania, na awo wabaa wadadu wedumika andenyi ya Hekalu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kufuma mzinyi, ukamdwa m'baa umu olusha wuda, na wanjama wasanu wa mwandu ghwa mzuri werekuloghe mzinyi, na mtesia wa m'baa olusha wuda; na karani wa m'baa wa majeshi ghelindia wandu wa isanga, na wandu mirongo irandadu wikulo mzinyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebuzaradani, uja m'baa wa walindiri ukawidwa na kuwighenja kwa mzuri aja Babuloni muzi ghwa Ribla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri wa Babuloni ukawikaba na kuwibwagha aho Ribla isanga ja Hamathi. Niko wandu wa Juda wikakaia wadwalwa wunyika na kufunywa isangenyi mzawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gedalia m'baa wa isanga ja Juda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
