            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri Nebukadnezari oremmbikieghe Gedalia mwana wa Ahikamu wawae Shafani, ukaie m'baa wa isanga ja Juda aighu ya wandu weresigharikieghe aho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.40.7+JER.40.8+JER.40.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jer. 40.7-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.41.1+JER.41.2+JER.41.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "41.1-3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji wabaa wose wa majeshi gha Juda na wandu wawo, awo wiseredwaloghe wunyika cha Babuloni wasikira wei Gedalia wabonywa kukaia m'baa wa isanga ni mzuri wa Babuloni, wikacha kwa Gedalia aho Mispa chiaimweri na wandu wawo. Wandu awo ni Ishmaeli mwana wa Nethania, na Johanani mwana wa Karea, na Seraia mwana wa Tanhumethi, Mnetofa, na Jaazania mwana wa Mmaaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Gedalia ukabonya ighemi kwawo na wandu wawo ukighamba, “Msekaie na wowa kwa wundu ghwa wabaa wa Babuloni, inyo kaienyi isangenyi, mumdumikie mzuri wa Babuloni, nenyo mchakaia nicha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela andenyi ya mori ghwa mfungade, Ishmaeli mwana wa Nethania, wawae Elishama wa kichuku cha kiwuzuri, ukachanya na wandu ikumi, wikamkaba Gedalia na kum'bwagha, chiaimweri na Wayahudi, na Wababuloni werekwanyeghe aho Mispa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko wandu wose, wa ndonyi na waighu, na wabaa wa majeshi, wikawuka na kughenda Misri, kwa kukaia werewiobughe Wababuloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.43.5+JER.43.6+JER.43.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jer. 43.5-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jehoiakini kufungulwa kufuma kifungonyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaka ghwa mirongo idadu na mfungade ghwa Jehoiakini mzuri wa Juda kudwalwa wunyika, mori ghwa ikumi na iwi, ituku ja mirongo iwi na mfungade ja ugho mori, Evil-merodaki mzuri wa Babuloni oremfunyireghe Jehoiakini kifungonyi, ugho mwaka ghoni uzoe kubonya nguma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukam'bonyera mecha na kumneka daraja mbaa kuchumba rose unekie wandu aho Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehoiakini ukafunya nguwo rake ra kifungonyi, ukakaia ukija mezenyi kwa mzuri matuku ghose gha irangi jake; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na kula ituku ukakaia ukinekwa ifungu jake ni mzuri matuku ghose orekaieghe moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
